{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Build workspace candidates before packing** \u2014 `--ignore-scripts` suppresses each package's `prepack` build, while their manifests publish only untracked `dist*` directories. A clean local `npm test` therefore packs candidates without entry points, while an existing stale build can make this regression test old code. Build core and OTel in the fixture/setup before packing, or selectively enable `prepack` for workspace candidates.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs74kjTq","finding_digest":"4f47773c4a23b1f9b06825a9b455381bd4501e4205ba554b1b718e48df17eb92","finding_id":"arf_v1_j5dxopckeoy7tmdiewu3ivjydp","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/__tests__/helpers/installed-core-fixture.ts::installedcorefixture::candidate-pack-requires-prebuilt-dist","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/__tests__/helpers/installed-core-fixture.ts::installedcorefixture::candidate-pack-requires-prebuilt-dist","line":75,"observation_digest":"d11ae646a396d64cba882d9eb0c0f46c1fb4db0038ae05a8751a32753bc51d4d","observation_id":"aro_v1_2enomrvds3lezouifwplbqhunq","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/__tests__/helpers/installed-core-fixture.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-02T22:26:59Z","review_id":"arr_v1_7wrlcr6ykvssruf4kd55sdihet","reviewed_base_sha":"0ee6c027ca3b58f3bf270fdf4a9ac87b73752467","reviewed_head_sha":"19b74eaf6f7adccd6d34051152b2d90cc6c600fb","reviewer":"codex","start_line":75,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":956},"record_id":"art_v1_ubpm3ovozthmptdk5v37ur3u5g","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-02T22:26:59Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
